WEBVTT

00:17:00.328 --> 00:17:02.915
People say to me,
"I don't know what to do!"

00:17:02.939 --> 00:17:04.580
Start to learn by doing.

00:17:05.074 --> 00:17:07.015
The more they practice citizen action,

00:17:07.039 --> 00:17:09.373
the more skilled and innovative
they become at it.

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:14.472
Like learning a trade, a profession,
a hobby, learning how to swim,

00:17:14.496 --> 00:17:17.378
their doubts, prejudgments and hesitancy

00:17:17.402 --> 00:17:20.497
begin to melt away
in the crucible of action.

00:17:20.521 --> 00:17:23.746
Their arguments for change
become deeper and sharper.

00:17:24.361 --> 00:17:27.704
From 1965 to 1966,

00:17:27.728 --> 00:17:30.983
when I was making the case
for safer automobiles,